    },

    // —— Act II infrastructure (act = 2) ————————————————————————————————————————————————
    // The fifty population-scale recipes. Each carries `.act = 2` so the Act I surfaces skip
    // it; most wait on a research tile through `requires.tech` (an id from
    // `assets/roster/technologies.zon`), offered only once that tile reads researched. A recipe
    // with no `tech` is open from the curtain. A good a verb's gate names opens that verb (the
    // firepit, the spring well, the forge, the settlement's garden bed); the rest are capital
    // that is simply owned. Amounts name only the `Resource` enum. Costs follow the prototype's
    // 50-recipe BUILD fixture; the three openers (firepit, spring well, lean-to) keep their
    // original shape.

